            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Fixed

- **Open Voice Studio now opens reliably.** Splash-screen actions use native macOS button tracking and no longer conflict with window dragging.
- The splash screen now uses Kiki's full dog-and-microphone app icon.

This update is fully local, Developer ID signed, notarized by Apple, and available through Kiki's built-in updater.
]]></description>
